  "body": "Crafted for multi-generational living and grand-scale entertaining, this thoughtfully designed home delivers flexible coastal living in the heart of Gulf Harbour.\r\n\r\nElevated and sun-drenched, the immaculate five-bedroom layout offers comfort and convenience at every turn. Featuring dual master suites, a designer kitchen, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow, every space is designed to impress.\r\n\r\nUpstairs serves as a quiet family sanctuary, hosting four generous bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a primary master suite with private ensuite and central TV lounge.\r\n\r\nThe lower level features a second master suite with ensuite and a guest toilet (4 toilets in total), ideal for guests or extended family, alongside versatile open-plan living areas centred around an oversized modern kitchen. Step straight out to extensive decking, offering fabulous outdoor entertaining spaces for family BBQs and get-togethers.\r\n\r\nComplete with double internal-access garaging, dedicated laundry facilities and ample storage, full double glazing, heat pump climate control, and underfloor bathroom heating, modern convenience is guaranteed.\r\n\r\nProperties of this scale and quality are highly sought after.\r\n\r\nSkip the traffic with the nearby ferry offering a scenic trip directly to the Auckland CBD or take advantage of world-class amenities right at your doorstep, including Whangaparaoa Golf Course, Shakespear Regional Park, vibrant local cafes, top schools and pristine local beaches.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and secure your family's future in Gulf Harbour",
